== Quest Start ==
Talk to Drakis Bloodcaster in the [[Plane of Sky]].

You say, 'Hail, Drakis Bloodcaster'
:''Drakis Bloodcaster says, 'Greetings, dark one.  Are you [ready to begin]?' ''
You say, 'ready to begin'
:''Drakis Bloodcaster says, 'Then choose, necromancer.  Do you wish to test your will, or your fortitude?  I can conduct the tests of [flight], [power], and the [mind] to test your will, along with tests of the [heart], [hands], and [finger], to test your body.  Stop wasting my time, and choose.' ''

== Necromancer Test of Flight ==

You say, 'flight'
:''Drakis Bloodcaster says, 'So, you wish to start upon the test of flight? So be it.  You must return to me a griffon's beak and a wind rune lena to reap your rewards.  May the darkness guide your steps.' ''

'''Reward:''' {{:Bloody Griffon-Hide Wrist Guard}}

